  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Music high school coop</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Musikh&#xf6;gskolan Balkan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kungliga Musikh&#xf6;gskolan i samarbete med Musikakademin i Sarajevo ordnar &#xe5;rliga musikseminarier f&#xf6;r musikh&#xf6;gskolor p&#xe5; hela Balkan i DUbrovnik. F&#xf6;r Winter School 2002, som &#xe4;ger rum i mars, har KMH beviljats 700 tkr.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Royal University College of Music in Stockholm will arrange a regional Winter School Music Seminar for all music academies on the Balkans. This years winter school takes place in Dubrovnik in March. THe Music academy of Sarajevo is partner in this work.</narrative>
  </description>
